# 测试reset

I definitions.inc

> init
<<<

+ test1.txt test1.txt
> add test1.txt
<<<

> commit "This is test1"
<<<

+ test2.txt test2.txt
> add test2.txt
<<<

> commit "This is test2"
<<<

# 此时应该存在两个文件
E test1.txt
E test2.txt

# 关键修改在这里：先 log，捕获 "This is test1" 的 Commit ID (它是第二个出现的，所以是 ${2})
> log
===
commit ([a-f0-9]+)
Date: .*
This is test2

===
commit ([a-f0-9]+)
Date: .*
This is test1

===
commit [a-f0-9]+
Date: .*
initial commit

<<<*

# 这里紧跟在 log 后面使用 ${2}，捕获组仍然有效
> reset ${2}
<<<*

# 重置之后只有 test1.txt 了
E test1.txt
* test2.txt